# Images get only what they need: everything is left out, then the needed paths are let back
# in. So `.env*`, `data/`, `models/`, `.venv/`, `tests/` and `docs/` never reach an image.
*
!alembic.ini
!config/prompts/
!deploy/api/requirements.lock
!deploy/web/Caddyfile
!frontend/
!src/
# The web image installs and builds the frontend itself.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/coverage/
# Settings files stay out even inside a let-in folder (Vite would build a VITE_* value into
# the screens).
**/.env*
**/__pycache__/
